# MERCATOR, combat: a jump to a RISKY system and a fight with a raider pack.
# Run: pocketme-sim --boot off --fps 60 --frames 3700 --script mercator-combat.script
# (from boards/desktop). MERCATOR's starting settings (2026-11-23): 60 pictures a second,
# the CHASE view and DETAIL HIGH; the scene plays at those and changes no setting.
# The start system is SECURE (no raiders near the station), so the scene jumps to XICRA
# (MINE, RISKY) first. The pilot's ship is lost at about frame 3640; nothing after 3590 is used.

# Home screen: seven steps right, from BENCH to MERCATOR, then start it.
5 press right
6 release right
8 press right
9 release right
11 press right
12 release right
14 press right
15 release right
17 press right
18 release right
20 press right
21 release right
23 press right
24 release right
32 press south
33 release south

100 press south          # PLAY: docked at JAKEL
101 release south

# The chart: set the course to XICRA (two steps right from JAKEL).
140 press down
141 release down
150 press down
151 release down
160 press down           # CHART line
161 release down
170 press south          # open the chart
171 release south
200 press right          # DRILO
201 release right
220 press right          # XICRA, MINE RISKY, 5.1 LY
221 release right
240 press south          # SET: COURSE SET
241 release south
260 press east           # back to the dock screen
261 release east
280 press up
281 release up
290 press up
291 release up
300 press up             # LAUNCH line
301 release up
320 press south          # launch
321 release south

# Fly out past 5 km (no jump closer to the station), then jump.
360 press west           # faster, to top speed
900 release west
1350 press minus         # SELECT: the chart, XICRA already chosen
1351 release minus
1380 press south         # A: jump (tunnel, then ARRIVED at about 1400)
1381 release south

# At XICRA: a pad 2 gunner holds the turret's trigger (it aims by itself
# at raiders within 1.5 km); the pilot slows, noses up at the pack and fires.
1500 p2 pad on
1501 p2 press south
1550 press east          # slower, down to a stop
1620 release east
# About 1600: RAIDERS ON THE RADAR.
1720 press up            # nose up towards the pack
1745 release up
1800 press south         # the nose laser, held (it overheats and cools by itself)
# Frames 3250-3590: the fight (the clip), seen from behind the ship. A raider
# goes down at 3312; another passes close on the left and goes down at 3561.
3690 release south
